	Sure, easy.  Get an amulet of alignment change, for one.  That
will allow you to sacrifice to the lawful/chaotic god, and if you have
two, they can be your most valuable possession.  Another thing you can
do, if you are a bit more radical, is (since you are neutral)
sacrifice a gray unicorn corpse at the altar which you want to convert
to (ie Lawful, chaotic).  Good hacking!



